from the comments in morena_morana's LJ:

I remember my now-deceased mother-in-law discovered the PSP in her fifties. Because Sanya never offered her to play, and she never imposed. Once he complained that his partner in some game ditched the evening game. Well, jokingly I say, why don't you invite mom. And she, he says, doesn't want to. To which I clarify: did you ask her?
Turned out mom very much wants to. And half an hour later she utterly destroyed Sashka's character. After that Sanya even hid the joystick from mom...

